{"availability":"available","full":"NovaCode37/Prism-platform","name":"Prism-platform","description":"Self-hosted OSINT platform. Point it at a domain, IP, email, phone or username and 26 modules run in parallel: WHOIS, DNS, threat intel, breaches, username search. One dashboard, an exposure score, an entity graph, HTML and PDF reports.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":240,"forks":107,"created":"2026-03-30T09:04:43Z","updated":"2026-10-05T14:57:33Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://getprism.su","topics":["ai","cybersecurity","docker","fastapi","geoint","hacking-tools","hacktoberfest","infosec","nextjs","osint","osint-framework","pentesting","python","reconnaissance","scraping","security","security-tools","self-hosted","socmint","threat-intelligence"],"demo":"https://getprism.su/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T09:11:12.461Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T09:11:12.461Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T09:11:12.461Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:16:57.925Z","stars":238,"forks":105},{"at":"2026-10-06T09:11:12.461Z","stars":240,"forks":107}],"technologies":["Next.js","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Self-hosted OSINT platform with 26 modules, OPSEC scoring, AI summary, and a real-time web dashboard.","Scan a domain, IP, email, phone or username and get WHOIS, DNS, threat intel, breach data, username search, dark-web mirrors, OPSEC score, entity graphs, and HTML/PDF reports in seconds.","Live Demo · Docker Quick Start · Configuration · Architecture · Security · Changelog · FAQ"],"features":["26 modules: WHOIS, DNS, crt.sh, Wayback Machine, Shodan, VirusTotal, AbuseIPDB, Censys, dark-web mirrors, email reputation, SMTP verify, breach lookup, Blackbird (50+ sites), Maigret (3000+ sites), Telegram, phone HLR,…","AI summary: written summary of the findings, plus a chat you can ask follow-up questions in. Needs an LLM provider of your own.","Real-time dashboard: WebSocket-driven scan progress with per-module progress, an entity graph and a GeoIP map","OPSEC Score: aggregated 0-100 exposure risk score across data exposure, identity, infrastructure and web security","HTML, PDF, CSV & Markdown reports: export full scan results as HTML, PDF, CSV, or Markdown (locale-aware EN/RU/DE)"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NovaCode37/Prism-platform/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e2d9cb0869110ac5136e27a32f2f5307e252a8a74b26ee5a6118800ce4625e8b","extractedAt":"2026-10-04T08:12:44.171Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:12:44.171Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Self-hosted OSINT platform with 26 modules, OPSEC scoring, AI summary, and a real-time web dashboard.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NovaCode37/Prism-platform/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"A self-hosted instance with your own provider responds at full speed.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NovaCode37/Prism-platform/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"not_required","text":"The example .env is intentionally easy to run: ALLOWANONAPI=true and no API key is required.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NovaCode37/Prism-platform/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"For any shared or public deployment, set ALLOWANONAPI=false, configure APIKEYS, and give the UI one accepted key.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NovaCode37/Prism-platform/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"The demo is a shared-hosting instance with anonymous access and a daily scan quota, so it hits limits the average self-hosted install never will.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NovaCode37/Prism-platform/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"e2d9cb0869110ac5136e27a32f2f5307e252a8a74b26ee5a6118800ce4625e8b","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NovaCode37/Prism-platform/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T08:12:44.172Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10